        <fr:taxon>Video Description</fr:taxon>
      </fr:frontmatter>
      <fr:mainmatter>
        <html:p>What does homotopy type theory mean? This video presents the first answer: HoTT is a typed programming language. Under this interpretation, the unit type 1 is the type of zero-tuples, a standard feature in many typed programming languages.</html:p>
