                <fr:taxon>Video Description</fr:taxon>
              </fr:frontmatter>
              <fr:mainmatter>
                <html:p>What does homotopy type theory mean? This video presents the next answer: HoTT is a language for describing spaces. Under this interpretation, the unit type 1 represents the space consisting of just a single point. This video informally introduces the idea of contractibility, which we'll rigorously define later and use extensively throughout HoTT.</html:p>
              </fr:mainmatter>
